1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:55,345 --> 00:01:56,945
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

3
00:01:57,025 --> 00:01:58,585
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

4
00:01:58,665 --> 00:02:00,985
Welcome home, Princess.

5
00:02:01,065 --> 00:02:02,065
All of you, rise.

6
00:02:23,705 --> 00:02:25,985
I've waited more than ten years.

7
00:02:26,065 --> 00:02:29,985
At last, the Princess has returned.

8
00:02:30,065 --> 00:02:31,025
You are...

9
00:02:32,545 --> 00:02:33,425
the old clan chief?

10
00:02:40,265 --> 00:02:42,745
Are you truly the Princess?

11
00:02:45,025 --> 00:02:47,945
The Princess really has returned!

12
00:02:50,985 --> 00:02:52,385
Of the twelve clan elders,

13
00:02:53,025 --> 00:02:57,025
I alone remain.

14
00:02:57,105 --> 00:03:00,145
To think the Princess still remembers me.

15
00:03:00,225 --> 00:03:02,785
Even if I died now,

16
00:03:04,025 --> 00:03:05,585
my life would have been worthwhile.

17
00:03:18,105 --> 00:03:20,065
Princess, drip your blood
on the clan register,

18
00:03:20,545 --> 00:03:21,625
then cast it into the altar.

19
00:03:22,225 --> 00:03:24,145
Swear before the Mystic Bird

20
00:03:24,225 --> 00:03:26,065
to reclaim our homeland

21
00:03:26,145 --> 00:03:28,705
and console the souls who died in agony.

22
00:03:33,865 --> 00:03:35,025
The Princess has returned!

23
00:03:35,105 --> 00:03:37,025
Reclaim our homeland!

24
00:03:37,105 --> 00:03:38,345
The Princess has returned!

25
00:03:38,425 --> 00:03:39,985
Reclaim our homeland!

26
00:03:40,065 --> 00:03:41,625
The Princess has returned!

27
00:03:41,705 --> 00:03:43,065
Reclaim our homeland!

28
00:03:43,665 --> 00:03:45,105
Ancestors above,

29
00:03:46,505 --> 00:03:49,505
I, your unworthy descendant Murong Yao,

30
00:03:50,065 --> 00:03:51,585
command as Princess:

31
00:03:53,625 --> 00:03:55,265
the Kingdom of Zhongwan

32
00:03:55,345 --> 00:03:56,865
shall never be restored.

33
00:04:01,785 --> 00:04:03,105
Princess!

34
00:04:03,185 --> 00:04:04,025
Princess!

35
00:04:04,625 --> 00:04:06,105
You've destroyed our people's last hope.

36
00:04:06,185 --> 00:04:07,305
If we do not restore Zhongwan,

37
00:04:07,385 --> 00:04:08,465
we betray our ancestors.

38
00:04:08,545 --> 00:04:09,425
The living

39
00:04:10,025 --> 00:04:11,105
matter more than spirit tablets.

40
00:04:11,825 --> 00:04:13,545
I only want to save
the people of Zhongwan.

41
00:04:22,985 --> 00:04:24,345
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

42
00:04:24,425 --> 00:04:26,865
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

43
00:04:26,945 --> 00:04:29,825
When my blood soaks this altar,

44
00:04:29,905 --> 00:04:34,505
the Mystic Bird will fully awaken.

45
00:04:34,585 --> 00:04:35,945
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

46
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,585
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

47
00:04:37,665 --> 00:04:39,305
I beg the Mystic Bird to open its eyes

48
00:04:39,385 --> 00:04:41,545
and give the Princess
the will to restore Zhongwan.

49
00:04:45,865 --> 00:04:46,785
Princess.

50
00:04:46,865 --> 00:04:48,625
The old clan chief's two sons

51
00:04:48,705 --> 00:04:50,665
both died in battle over ten years ago.

52
00:04:50,745 --> 00:04:52,825
His grandson died while fleeing
on a snowy night.

53
00:04:52,905 --> 00:04:55,105
He wept until he went blind.

54
00:04:55,825 --> 00:04:58,225
All these years, the only thing

55
00:04:58,825 --> 00:05:01,225
He stayed alive for one reason:
to see you one last time.

56
00:05:01,305 --> 00:05:02,985
Because he always believed

57
00:05:03,065 --> 00:05:05,025
you would come back.

58
00:05:14,505 --> 00:05:16,905
These two people
volunteered as sacrifices.

59
00:05:16,985 --> 00:05:18,105
One

60
00:05:18,185 --> 00:05:20,585
lost his son building canals for Daning.

61
00:05:20,665 --> 00:05:21,945
The other

62
00:05:22,025 --> 00:05:24,305
lost his entire family,
buried alive when Zhongwan fell.

63
00:05:26,585 --> 00:05:28,105
My entire Shangguan clan

64
00:05:29,625 --> 00:05:31,865
also died at Daning hands.

65
00:05:34,105 --> 00:05:36,305
Without the hope of restoring Zhongwan,

66
00:05:37,545 --> 00:05:39,105
not one person here

67
00:05:40,465 --> 00:05:42,345
would have survived until today.

68
00:05:55,225 --> 00:05:57,265
Princess, change out of that.

69
00:05:57,825 --> 00:05:58,825
The Princess of Zhongwan

70
00:05:59,385 --> 00:06:01,505
should not wear the robes
of an enemy Empress.

71
00:06:18,745 --> 00:06:20,825
Zhongwan dress suits you better, Princess.

72
00:06:21,745 --> 00:06:23,945
Come. Pay respects to our ancestors.

73
00:06:29,945 --> 00:06:31,265
Ancestors above,

74
00:06:32,665 --> 00:06:34,985
I, your unworthy descendant Murong Yao,

75
00:06:35,065 --> 00:06:36,225
have returned too late.

76
00:06:37,225 --> 00:06:40,385
To let Zhongwan's people live and prosper

77
00:06:40,465 --> 00:06:42,745
is my duty as their Princess.

78
00:06:44,385 --> 00:06:46,105
I will never allow the flames of war

79
00:06:46,185 --> 00:06:47,225
to descend on Zhongwan again.

80
00:06:48,265 --> 00:06:49,105
Princess.

81
00:06:49,585 --> 00:06:51,505
Swear before our ancestors.

82
00:06:51,585 --> 00:06:52,745
Say you will restore Zhongwan

83
00:06:53,345 --> 00:06:54,585
and reclaim our homeland.

84
00:07:00,385 --> 00:07:01,385
Yin Qing.

85
00:07:01,465 --> 00:07:03,385
Isn't letting our people live and prosper

86
00:07:04,025 --> 00:07:05,585
more important than killing
to restore a kingdom?

87
00:07:06,265 --> 00:07:07,945
I've brought all of you home safely.

88
00:07:08,665 --> 00:07:10,345
Now I must follow the path
I believe is right.

89
00:07:10,425 --> 00:07:12,105
What are you going to do?

90
00:07:12,185 --> 00:07:14,225
Daning has abolished
permanent slave status.

91
00:07:15,105 --> 00:07:16,745
The new policy will be implemented.

92
00:07:16,825 --> 00:07:19,665
I will return to Daning
as Zhongwan's Princess

93
00:07:19,745 --> 00:07:21,745
and negotiate peace with its Emperor,

94
00:07:22,585 --> 00:07:24,505
to secure a future for our people.

95
00:07:24,585 --> 00:07:26,865
Do you know what's happening
in the Zhongwan slave camp?

96
00:07:26,945 --> 00:07:29,025
You think a few new policies from Ying Gua

97
00:07:29,105 --> 00:07:32,065
can erase our people's
suffering and humiliation?

98
00:07:32,145 --> 00:07:34,545
Do you know what Daning
has done to Zhongwan?

99
00:07:35,185 --> 00:07:36,545
When Zhongwan is restored,

100
00:07:37,265 --> 00:07:40,465
Daning will repay every debt.

101
00:07:40,545 --> 00:07:41,705
Restoration

102
00:07:42,625 --> 00:07:43,545
is your obsession,

103
00:07:43,625 --> 00:07:44,785
not mine.

104
00:07:45,385 --> 00:07:47,345
I only want to save my people.

105
00:07:47,905 --> 00:07:48,745
Sir.

106
00:07:49,385 --> 00:07:51,745
Perhaps Zhongwan can win peace

107
00:07:52,425 --> 00:07:53,585
without shedding a drop of blood.

108
00:07:56,585 --> 00:07:57,505
Get out.

109
00:08:03,665 --> 00:08:05,505
You are Zhongwan's Princess.

110
00:08:05,585 --> 00:08:07,545
What will it take for you
to come to your senses?

111
00:08:07,625 --> 00:08:09,385
You must restore Zhongwan.

112
00:08:09,465 --> 00:08:10,985
Come. Tell our ancestors

113
00:08:11,065 --> 00:08:12,345
you will restore Zhongwan.

114
00:08:12,425 --> 00:08:13,425
You will restore Zhongwan!

115
00:08:13,505 --> 00:08:14,345
You will restore Zhongwan!

116
00:08:14,425 --> 00:08:17,185
You will restore Zhongwan!

117
00:08:34,505 --> 00:08:35,345
Yao'er.

118
00:08:53,425 --> 00:08:54,785
You're bleeding.

119
00:08:58,465 --> 00:08:59,585
I'll stay with you.

120
00:09:08,465 --> 00:09:09,425
Yin Qing.

121
00:09:09,505 --> 00:09:11,265
-Have you lost your mind?
-I'm not mad.

122
00:09:12,905 --> 00:09:14,025
I am Shangguan Zhao.

123
00:09:14,825 --> 00:09:16,225
I am your Brother Shangguan.

124
00:09:16,305 --> 00:09:17,825
My Brother Shangguan

125
00:09:17,905 --> 00:09:19,745
died more than ten years ago.

126
00:09:20,385 --> 00:09:21,425
The man who lived

127
00:09:21,505 --> 00:09:23,505
was Yin Qing, who gave me the Rain Bell

128
00:09:24,745 --> 00:09:26,025
and told me that even the fiercest storm

129
00:09:26,105 --> 00:09:27,865
would one day pass.

130
00:09:33,265 --> 00:09:35,705
There is no Yin Qing in this world.

131
00:09:36,705 --> 00:09:37,625
To restore Zhongwan,

132
00:09:38,385 --> 00:09:40,985
I could even grovel before Ying Gua.

133
00:09:41,865 --> 00:09:44,465
No one can stop my plan
to restore our kingdom.

134
00:09:50,665 --> 00:09:51,985
Not even you.

135
00:09:57,465 --> 00:09:58,585
Your road

136
00:10:00,185 --> 00:10:02,225
ends in everyone's grave.

137
00:10:02,865 --> 00:10:04,545
The road I seek may be harder,

138
00:10:06,105 --> 00:10:07,905
but it is a road meant for the living.

139
00:10:12,465 --> 00:10:13,545
Guards.

140
00:10:31,785 --> 00:10:32,865
Yao'er.

141
00:10:34,225 --> 00:10:35,545
Once Ying Gua is dead

142
00:10:36,065 --> 00:10:37,585
and Daning's imperial clan destroyed,

143
00:10:38,265 --> 00:10:39,665
we'll play hide-and-seek again,

144
00:10:41,145 --> 00:10:42,505
just like when we were children.

145
00:10:53,425 --> 00:10:54,625
I'll leave the tavern in your hands.

146
00:10:54,705 --> 00:10:55,545
Keep the accounts as usual.

147
00:10:55,625 --> 00:10:56,665
If any important guests ask,

148
00:10:56,745 --> 00:10:58,025
say I've gone out of town
to visit relatives.

149
00:10:59,785 --> 00:11:00,665
Manager Yan.

150
00:11:00,745 --> 00:11:02,265
It's too dangerous to go alone.

151
00:11:04,265 --> 00:11:05,105
Young Lord Shen.

152
00:11:05,185 --> 00:11:06,465
You came at the perfect time.

153
00:11:06,545 --> 00:11:07,745
Please talk some sense into Manager Yan.

154
00:11:07,825 --> 00:11:08,665
Zhaocai.

155
00:11:14,265 --> 00:11:15,145
You're going to find her?

156
00:11:19,625 --> 00:11:21,185
I drew my sword that day for Daning.

157
00:11:21,265 --> 00:11:22,265
If she makes no move to restore Zhongwan,

158
00:11:22,345 --> 00:11:24,025
I will not harm a hair on her head.

159
00:11:24,105 --> 00:11:25,505
And if she does intend to restore it?

160
00:11:25,585 --> 00:11:27,665
If I protect her and stand against you,

161
00:11:27,745 --> 00:11:29,145
will you kill me too?

162
00:11:34,905 --> 00:11:36,065
That day will never come.

163
00:11:38,345 --> 00:11:40,025
If you harm her in the slightest,

164
00:11:40,105 --> 00:11:41,265
I will never forgive you.

165
00:11:41,345 --> 00:11:43,465
I don't care if she's Daning
or Zhongwan.

166
00:11:43,545 --> 00:11:44,665
She's the only person I care about.

167
00:11:45,665 --> 00:11:46,705
I'm going to find her now.

168
00:11:47,585 --> 00:11:48,425
Fuzhi.

169
00:11:49,665 --> 00:11:51,425
His Majesty has decided
to lead the campaign himself.

170
00:11:51,505 --> 00:11:52,345
I'll take you to find her.

171
00:12:09,825 --> 00:12:11,385
Fellow student, you dropped your inkstick.

172
00:12:12,985 --> 00:12:14,265
Thank you, miss.

173
00:12:18,065 --> 00:12:19,065
This pot of Courtyard Fragrance

174
00:12:19,145 --> 00:12:20,585
I grew it myself.

175
00:12:20,665 --> 00:12:21,905
It's for Lord Meng.

176
00:12:21,985 --> 00:12:22,825
Keep it on your desk.

177
00:12:22,905 --> 00:12:24,225
Its scent will calm the mind.

178
00:12:28,025 --> 00:12:29,905
It really is wonderfully fragrant.

179
00:12:32,545 --> 00:12:33,945
On our first day here,

180
00:12:34,025 --> 00:12:36,065
shall we turn this cold, dreary Office

181
00:12:36,145 --> 00:12:38,665
into the capital's most elegant bureau?

182
00:12:38,745 --> 00:12:39,985
All right.

183
00:12:43,705 --> 00:12:44,945
You suffered so much growing up,

184
00:12:45,465 --> 00:12:47,385
yet still placed first
in all three examinations.

185
00:12:47,465 --> 00:12:49,105
I truly admire you.

186
00:12:50,985 --> 00:12:53,385
I don't know how to express what I feel.

187
00:12:55,945 --> 00:12:57,385
I only hope these little things

188
00:12:58,705 --> 00:13:00,625
can warm the cold memories of your past.

189
00:13:07,305 --> 00:13:08,145
Zhili.

190
00:13:08,945 --> 00:13:10,545
Why are your eyes red?

191
00:13:11,665 --> 00:13:12,905
It's all behind you now.

192
00:13:12,985 --> 00:13:14,345
Everything ahead can be new.

193
00:13:23,385 --> 00:13:24,945
If you've found a good man,

194
00:13:25,905 --> 00:13:27,705
perhaps you should give
each other a chance.

195
00:13:30,225 --> 00:13:31,385
He's so good to me.

196
00:13:33,385 --> 00:13:34,585
Sometimes I feel

197
00:13:35,505 --> 00:13:36,665
I've only held him back.

198
00:13:36,745 --> 00:13:37,905
Mengmeng.

199
00:13:38,785 --> 00:13:39,905
Tell me.

200
00:13:39,985 --> 00:13:41,345
Why did I agree

201
00:13:41,425 --> 00:13:43,785
-to this marriage in the first place?
-When pain becomes unbearable,

202
00:13:44,385 --> 00:13:45,985
people always reach for
something to hold on to.

203
00:13:46,865 --> 00:13:48,105
Anian was the lamp in the fog

204
00:13:48,185 --> 00:13:49,985
that showed you the way forward.

205
00:13:50,065 --> 00:13:51,625
You understand each other,

206
00:13:52,225 --> 00:13:54,105
and he can give you the peace you need.

207
00:13:55,745 --> 00:13:57,385
But I do care about him.

208
00:13:57,465 --> 00:13:59,065
I can't bear to see him hurt,

209
00:13:59,145 --> 00:14:00,945
much less see him suffer because of me.

210
00:14:01,025 --> 00:14:02,225
You don't need to feel guilty.

211
00:14:02,305 --> 00:14:04,985
I only hope you can slowly
lower your guard.

212
00:14:05,825 --> 00:14:07,145
Anian is worth it.

213
00:14:20,665 --> 00:14:21,985
This is a farewell drink.

214
00:14:22,985 --> 00:14:23,825
Are you going to stop me?

215
00:14:40,745 --> 00:14:41,705
I trust her.

216
00:14:42,665 --> 00:14:44,185
Though she is a survivor of Zhongwan,

217
00:14:45,385 --> 00:14:46,785
she would never harm Daning.

218
00:14:48,585 --> 00:14:49,425
Anian.

219
00:14:50,625 --> 00:14:52,545
I want to join the campaign with you

220
00:14:52,625 --> 00:14:53,785
and find Mengmeng.

221
00:14:54,865 --> 00:14:55,945
Zhili.

222
00:14:56,025 --> 00:14:57,265
No matter how deep our personal bonds,

223
00:14:57,345 --> 00:14:59,745
we cannot let private feelings
interfere with state affairs.

224
00:14:59,825 --> 00:15:01,505
The front lines are dangerous.

225
00:15:02,065 --> 00:15:04,545
Miss Yan and my brother
will escort supplies,

226
00:15:04,625 --> 00:15:06,305
so they can avoid
the worst of the fighting.

227
00:15:06,385 --> 00:15:07,625
But I

228
00:15:08,185 --> 00:15:09,585
must stand at the very front.

229
00:15:11,425 --> 00:15:12,265
If you come with me,

230
00:15:12,345 --> 00:15:14,185
whenever the beacons are lit,

231
00:15:14,265 --> 00:15:16,025
your safety will be
the first thing on my mind.

232
00:15:16,105 --> 00:15:17,625
I will be distracted.

233
00:15:21,265 --> 00:15:23,225
But I'm truly worried about Mengmeng.

234
00:15:29,425 --> 00:15:30,585
And about you.

235
00:15:37,985 --> 00:15:39,105
Zhili.

236
00:15:39,905 --> 00:15:40,785
Do you...

237
00:15:45,745 --> 00:15:47,025
like me, even a little now?

238
00:16:03,785 --> 00:16:04,665
You said

239
00:16:06,505 --> 00:16:07,945
this peachwood brings good fortune

240
00:16:08,025 --> 00:16:09,745
and keeps its wearer safe.

241
00:16:11,945 --> 00:16:12,905
Wear it.

242
00:16:17,105 --> 00:16:18,505
I want you to come back safely.

243
00:16:21,745 --> 00:16:22,865
I understand.

244
00:16:25,665 --> 00:16:27,785
I leave tomorrow at the Hour of the Tiger.

245
00:16:27,865 --> 00:16:29,785
I won't disturb you tonight.

246
00:16:32,865 --> 00:16:33,865
Anian.

247
00:16:47,105 --> 00:16:47,945
Zhili.

248
00:17:48,625 --> 00:17:49,785
Madam.

249
00:17:49,865 --> 00:17:51,145
Before the Marquis left,

250
00:17:51,225 --> 00:17:52,785
he ordered us to take good care of you.

251
00:17:52,865 --> 00:17:55,385
We heard you cough twice this morning,

252
00:17:55,465 --> 00:17:57,865
and the weather has been turning colder.

253
00:17:58,385 --> 00:18:00,345
The household has prepared
a Cold-Dispelling Formula.

254
00:18:00,425 --> 00:18:02,025
It is excellent for driving out chills
and strengthening the body.

255
00:18:48,665 --> 00:18:49,705
Still trying to escape, Princess?

256
00:18:49,785 --> 00:18:51,425
I'm going to find a way

257
00:18:51,505 --> 00:18:52,585
for the people of Zhongwan to survive.

258
00:18:53,225 --> 00:18:54,985
Mr. Shangguan gave orders:

259
00:18:55,065 --> 00:18:56,545
if the Princess escapes,

260
00:18:56,625 --> 00:18:59,345
every guard and maid assigned to watch you

261
00:18:59,425 --> 00:19:01,145
will be sent to the Zhongwan slave camp.

262
00:19:01,985 --> 00:19:04,465
Bodies are piled
at alley entrances every day.

263
00:19:04,545 --> 00:19:05,705
Some

264
00:19:05,785 --> 00:19:07,745
stole nothing more than half
a stale flatbread,

265
00:19:09,105 --> 00:19:10,465
yet were hung from the camp gate

266
00:19:10,985 --> 00:19:11,825
and strangled to death.

267
00:19:13,425 --> 00:19:14,745
Princess,

268
00:19:15,705 --> 00:19:17,065
please let them live.

269
00:19:17,705 --> 00:19:19,385
If you truly regard me as your Princess,

270
00:19:21,425 --> 00:19:23,305
why is every word I say

271
00:19:23,985 --> 00:19:25,945
worth less than one threat from him?

272
00:19:26,025 --> 00:19:27,785
Since returning to Zhongwan,

273
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:31,105
I've kept dreaming of Yin Qing.

274
00:19:31,625 --> 00:19:32,945
Back at the Office,

275
00:19:34,585 --> 00:19:36,465
during the three years
he stayed by my side,

276
00:19:38,585 --> 00:19:40,105
he was always smiling,

277
00:19:41,705 --> 00:19:42,825
always joking,

278
00:19:44,865 --> 00:19:46,465
finding new ways to make me laugh.

279
00:19:47,385 --> 00:19:48,945
Every day, he was also the one

280
00:19:49,025 --> 00:19:50,385
who cooked a whole table of dishes,

281
00:19:51,745 --> 00:19:53,945
saying he was rewarding Zhili and me.

282
00:19:54,025 --> 00:19:55,545
Whenever danger came,

283
00:19:56,665 --> 00:19:58,025
he never hesitated

284
00:19:58,105 --> 00:19:59,385
to put himself between us and harm.

285
00:19:59,465 --> 00:20:01,025
How could a man like that

286
00:20:01,105 --> 00:20:04,105
become what he is now?

287
00:20:04,185 --> 00:20:05,425
Princess.

288
00:20:05,505 --> 00:20:07,105
Deep down,

289
00:20:08,265 --> 00:20:10,105
he is a kind man.

290
00:20:14,665 --> 00:20:15,985
You love him.

291
00:20:18,865 --> 00:20:20,065
When Zhongwan fell,

292
00:20:20,585 --> 00:20:22,305
I was sent to Qingzhou as a slave.

293
00:20:23,105 --> 00:20:24,185
That beast of a county magistrate

294
00:20:24,265 --> 00:20:26,225
took me home and forced me
to serve as his household courtesan.

295
00:20:27,225 --> 00:20:28,345
He tormented me day and night.

296
00:20:29,825 --> 00:20:30,665
That life

297
00:20:31,185 --> 00:20:33,065
was even worse than the slave camp.

298
00:20:38,825 --> 00:20:39,985
It was Mr. Shangguan

299
00:20:40,065 --> 00:20:42,225
who saved me when I had lost all hope.

300
00:20:42,305 --> 00:20:43,505
He gave me a new identity

301
00:20:44,585 --> 00:20:46,345
and let me live with dignity again.

302
00:20:47,905 --> 00:20:49,105
Whatever he does,

303
00:20:50,065 --> 00:20:51,345
I will stay beside him

304
00:20:52,825 --> 00:20:53,665
and support him.

305
00:21:04,465 --> 00:21:06,145
Then you have even more reason to help me

306
00:21:08,185 --> 00:21:10,065
stop him from going
further down this path.

307
00:21:12,225 --> 00:21:13,625
I want to see the Zhongwan slave camp.

308
00:21:16,305 --> 00:21:17,225
Take me there.

309
00:21:21,865 --> 00:21:22,825
-Hurry up!
-Stop drinking!

310
00:21:22,905 --> 00:21:23,745
Move!

311
00:21:23,825 --> 00:21:24,825
Get to work! Move!

312
00:21:26,705 --> 00:21:28,625
-Get up!
-Stop slacking!

313
00:21:28,705 --> 00:21:29,745
Move!

314
00:21:29,825 --> 00:21:31,225
-Get up!
-Faster!

315
00:21:31,305 --> 00:21:32,185
I'm talking to you!

316
00:21:32,265 --> 00:21:33,345
Get up!

317
00:21:33,425 --> 00:21:34,265
Are you getting up or not?

318
00:21:34,345 --> 00:21:35,545
Princess.

319
00:21:35,625 --> 00:21:37,225
The Zhongwan slave camp
is heavily guarded.

320
00:21:37,305 --> 00:21:38,705
We can only watch from a distance.

321
00:21:38,785 --> 00:21:40,385
At the Zhongwan slave camp,

322
00:21:40,465 --> 00:21:43,065
they mine ore, build tombs and dig canals.

323
00:21:44,065 --> 00:21:45,705
Wherever there is work that kills men,

324
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:47,185
our Zhongwan people

325
00:21:47,265 --> 00:21:48,625
are driven there.

326
00:21:49,745 --> 00:21:51,745
It has been more than ten years.

327
00:21:51,825 --> 00:21:53,705
Mr. Shangguan tried bribing officials

328
00:21:53,785 --> 00:21:55,185
and organizing escapes.

329
00:21:56,185 --> 00:21:58,665
But once branded as a Zhongwan slave,

330
00:21:58,745 --> 00:22:00,225
even if you flee to the ends of the earth,

331
00:22:01,265 --> 00:22:02,945
you'll be dragged back and executed.

332
00:22:04,185 --> 00:22:05,425
Princess.

333
00:22:07,825 --> 00:22:09,625
The hope that keeps these people alive

334
00:22:11,625 --> 00:22:13,905
is something only you can give them.

335
00:22:31,065 --> 00:22:31,905
Princess.

336
00:22:32,745 --> 00:22:34,225
Every day we delay,

337
00:22:34,305 --> 00:22:36,225
dozens more Zhongwan bodies are added.

338
00:22:36,865 --> 00:22:38,385
You've seen the slave camp now.

339
00:22:39,185 --> 00:22:40,465
Do you still refuse to restore Zhongwan?

340
00:22:41,025 --> 00:22:42,345
If you can find a way

341
00:22:43,465 --> 00:22:45,385
without spilling a single drop
of Zhongwan blood,

342
00:22:46,665 --> 00:22:48,185
then I will restore our kingdom.

343
00:22:49,065 --> 00:22:50,305
Once you and I marry,

344
00:22:50,825 --> 00:22:52,665
we can draw Beijian into the war

345
00:22:52,745 --> 00:22:54,105
and let them fight at the front.

346
00:23:04,785 --> 00:23:05,665
I agree.

347
00:23:06,865 --> 00:23:08,345
But I have three conditions.

348
00:23:09,185 --> 00:23:10,145
First,

349
00:23:11,145 --> 00:23:13,145
all of Zhongwan will obey my orders,

350
00:23:13,745 --> 00:23:14,625
including you.

351
00:23:14,705 --> 00:23:16,145
Second,

352
00:23:16,225 --> 00:23:17,825
all plans made with Beijian

353
00:23:18,545 --> 00:23:20,265
will be under my direct command.

354
00:23:20,345 --> 00:23:21,465
Third,

355
00:23:22,705 --> 00:23:23,865
from this day forward,

356
00:23:25,345 --> 00:23:27,345
you will never again use anyone

357
00:23:27,425 --> 00:23:28,905
or anything to threaten me.

358
00:23:28,985 --> 00:23:30,225
I agree to all three.

359
00:23:31,625 --> 00:23:32,465
Princess.

360
00:23:33,905 --> 00:23:34,865
You've finally come to your senses.

361
00:23:38,745 --> 00:23:41,705
I watched my royal parents
die before my eyes.

362
00:23:42,265 --> 00:23:43,385
The people of Zhongwan

363
00:23:43,465 --> 00:23:45,305
were branded as Daning's slaves.

364
00:23:45,945 --> 00:23:48,385
I am the last of Zhongwan's royal line.

365
00:23:49,345 --> 00:23:50,265
This realm

366
00:23:50,745 --> 00:23:52,585
I will reclaim with my own hands.

367
00:23:56,425 --> 00:23:57,865
The Mystic Bird returns.

368
00:23:59,185 --> 00:24:00,185
I, Shangguan Zhao,

369
00:24:00,945 --> 00:24:02,665
swear to follow the Princess unto death.

370
00:24:02,745 --> 00:24:04,545
If you acknowledge me as your Princess,

371
00:24:06,265 --> 00:24:08,105
then kneel when you speak to me.

372
00:24:18,465 --> 00:24:20,185
I will not remain merely a Princess.

373
00:24:20,265 --> 00:24:23,025
I am the last of Zhongwan's royal blood.

374
00:24:23,705 --> 00:24:26,265
I will become Zhongwan's
first female sovereign.

375
00:24:28,945 --> 00:24:30,265
The day I ascend the throne

376
00:24:31,865 --> 00:24:33,865
will be the day you and I marry.

377
00:24:36,425 --> 00:24:37,385
Shangguan Zhao

378
00:24:38,265 --> 00:24:39,105
accepts the command.

379
00:24:45,025 --> 00:24:46,305
Yeqi has sent an alliance pact.

380
00:24:46,385 --> 00:24:47,745
Taishui has submitted its surrender.

381
00:24:48,305 --> 00:24:49,425
Di Nian, Zhishu,

382
00:24:49,505 --> 00:24:50,785
the way you fought those two campaigns

383
00:24:50,865 --> 00:24:52,545
had the spirit of Marquis Wu in his prime.

384
00:24:53,865 --> 00:24:55,185
I was fortunate not to fail my mission.

385
00:24:55,265 --> 00:24:56,105
General Di.

386
00:24:57,625 --> 00:24:58,465
Your Majesty.

387
00:24:58,545 --> 00:25:00,985
Beijian has cut our supply route
for over seven days.

388
00:25:01,065 --> 00:25:03,065
Our wounded lack doctors
and medicine. It's critical.

389
00:25:03,145 --> 00:25:04,945
Fuzhi has contacted merchant guilds
in every prefecture.

390
00:25:05,025 --> 00:25:06,425
They are willing to gather
supplies together.

391
00:25:06,505 --> 00:25:07,585
Your Majesty.

392
00:25:07,665 --> 00:25:09,345
I will stake my entire fortune

393
00:25:09,425 --> 00:25:11,345
and persuade them to release
their supplies

394
00:25:11,425 --> 00:25:12,745
to relieve our army's urgent need.

395
00:25:12,825 --> 00:25:14,265
If we lose this war,

396
00:25:14,745 --> 00:25:15,785
as the foremost merchant
on these trade routes,

397
00:25:15,865 --> 00:25:17,145
you will be the first
they settle accounts with.

398
00:25:17,225 --> 00:25:19,225
Everything you've built over the years

399
00:25:19,305 --> 00:25:20,545
will be lost.

400
00:25:20,625 --> 00:25:22,745
Without a country,
how can there be a home?

401
00:25:22,825 --> 00:25:25,385
I only hope this war ends soon

402
00:25:25,465 --> 00:25:26,745
so I can be reunited with Mengmeng.

403
00:25:27,665 --> 00:25:28,545
Within three days,

404
00:25:28,625 --> 00:25:30,345
the first medicines will reach the army.

405
00:25:30,425 --> 00:25:32,185
Miss Yan, your sense of duty honors you.

406
00:25:32,265 --> 00:25:34,105
On behalf of the whole army, I thank you.

407
00:25:34,185 --> 00:25:35,185
Zhishu.

408
00:25:35,265 --> 00:25:36,825
Take Miss Yan through the western gorge.

409
00:25:36,905 --> 00:25:38,665
Gather the supplies and keep her safe.

410
00:25:38,745 --> 00:25:40,825
I will not let a hair
on her head be harmed.

411
00:25:40,905 --> 00:25:41,745
Your Majesty.

412
00:25:41,825 --> 00:25:42,785
Urgent report.

413
00:25:43,505 --> 00:25:45,305
The Zhongwan rebels
sent a message by arrow.

414
00:25:45,385 --> 00:25:46,545
They say Lord Meng...

415
00:25:47,545 --> 00:25:48,385
Speak.

416
00:25:49,545 --> 00:25:50,665
Lord Meng intends to proclaim
herself sovereign

417
00:25:50,745 --> 00:25:51,865
and establish her own rule.

418
00:25:54,905 --> 00:25:56,345
Beijian cuts our supplies.

419
00:25:56,425 --> 00:25:57,465
Zhongwan sows chaos in our ranks.

420
00:25:57,545 --> 00:25:59,665
They mean to trap Your Majesty
between threats at home and abroad.

421
00:25:59,745 --> 00:26:00,825
Your Majesty.

422
00:26:00,905 --> 00:26:02,465
We must strike first and end this threat.

423
00:26:02,545 --> 00:26:03,625
Shen Zhishu.

424
00:26:03,705 --> 00:26:05,705
The Shen clan's duty for generations

425
00:26:05,785 --> 00:26:07,825
is to protect His Majesty
and defend Daning.

426
00:26:07,905 --> 00:26:09,585
Even if you hate me for it today,

427
00:26:10,065 --> 00:26:11,345
I will still stand my ground.

428
00:26:11,425 --> 00:26:13,105
As Zhongwan's Princess, Meng Tinghui

429
00:26:13,185 --> 00:26:15,265
is the hope that keeps her people alive.

430
00:26:15,345 --> 00:26:17,665
Whether or not she becomes
their sovereign,

431
00:26:17,745 --> 00:26:19,225
in her present circumstances,

432
00:26:19,985 --> 00:26:22,065
this may be her only choice.

433
00:26:24,585 --> 00:26:26,825
Even if Beijian and Zhongwan ally,

434
00:26:26,905 --> 00:26:27,785
we still have another move.

435
00:26:33,625 --> 00:26:35,145
Beijian's Second Prince died in Daning.

436
00:26:35,225 --> 00:26:37,585
It was the work of Emperor Ying Gua.

437
00:26:37,665 --> 00:26:39,385
Yeqi has now submitted,

438
00:26:39,465 --> 00:26:41,385
and Taishui cannot withstand him either.

439
00:26:41,465 --> 00:26:43,465
Only if you and I join forces

440
00:26:43,545 --> 00:26:46,025
can we face Daning's 100,000 iron cavalry.

441
00:26:46,105 --> 00:26:48,905
Zhongwan has been gone for years.

442
00:26:49,505 --> 00:26:51,425
You're nothing but a homeless cur.

443
00:26:51,505 --> 00:26:52,905
What gives you the right
to bargain with us?

444
00:26:52,985 --> 00:26:54,385
Because Zhongwan's Princess

445
00:26:55,185 --> 00:26:56,505
is the woman Ying Gua loves.

446
00:26:58,025 --> 00:26:59,345
Besides,

447
00:27:00,105 --> 00:27:02,105
the Princess and I
have long been betrothed.

448
00:27:02,185 --> 00:27:03,385
We will marry very soon.

449
00:27:06,545 --> 00:27:07,465
Shangguan Zhao.

450
00:27:08,185 --> 00:27:10,785
You come into my command tent
with nothing but words

451
00:27:10,865 --> 00:27:13,665
and expect Beijian's cavalry
to believe you?

452
00:27:13,745 --> 00:27:16,385
You're only the leader
of the Blood Moon Society.

453
00:27:17,025 --> 00:27:17,865
Beijian

454
00:27:17,945 --> 00:27:19,585
recognizes only true kings.

455
00:27:20,345 --> 00:27:21,345
In that case,

456
00:27:22,185 --> 00:27:23,865
would Your Highness
be willing to ally with me?

457
00:27:31,505 --> 00:27:33,505
Zhongwan has been gone for years.

458
00:27:34,585 --> 00:27:36,185
What do you have to offer
me in an alliance?

459
00:27:36,265 --> 00:27:38,105
In this war between Beijian and Daning,

460
00:27:38,625 --> 00:27:41,425
I'll teach you how to win.

461
00:27:43,625 --> 00:27:45,305
He'll station heavy forces here.

462
00:27:46,065 --> 00:27:47,665
So we should take

463
00:27:47,745 --> 00:27:48,865
Xigu Pass.

464
00:27:48,945 --> 00:27:50,585
-Kill!
-Kill!

465
00:27:50,665 --> 00:27:52,905
Beijian will certainly detour
through Xigu Pass.

466
00:27:52,985 --> 00:27:55,345
Di Nian, lead troops to intercept
and pursue them.

467
00:27:55,425 --> 00:27:57,185
Xigu Pass is lightly defended.

468
00:27:57,265 --> 00:27:59,425
-Then why, Your Majesty?
-Precisely because it is lightly defended,

469
00:27:59,505 --> 00:28:00,985
it will be her choice.

470
00:28:01,785 --> 00:28:03,545
She knows I'll set an ambush
on the trade route.

471
00:28:03,625 --> 00:28:05,305
I know she'll find another path.

472
00:28:05,385 --> 00:28:06,585
How could Zhongwan's Princess

473
00:28:06,665 --> 00:28:08,945
know Daning's troop deployments?

474
00:28:09,025 --> 00:28:11,105
Because he already anticipated

475
00:28:11,185 --> 00:28:13,065
that I would anticipate his every move.

476
00:28:13,145 --> 00:28:14,305
If we want to win,

477
00:28:15,185 --> 00:28:16,625
we must make him believe

478
00:28:16,705 --> 00:28:18,785
everything is still under his control.

479
00:28:18,865 --> 00:28:21,785
No one understands her thoughts
better than I do.

480
00:28:22,785 --> 00:28:24,425
Tonight I will lead our elite troops

481
00:28:24,505 --> 00:28:25,425
to scout the enemy camp myself.

482
00:28:25,505 --> 00:28:26,345
Di Nian.

483
00:28:26,425 --> 00:28:28,545
I will lead troops in a feint.

484
00:28:55,585 --> 00:28:56,665
Fuzhi.

485
00:28:56,745 --> 00:28:58,425
You've gone all day without food or water

486
00:28:58,505 --> 00:28:59,705
while gathering supplies. Eat something.

487
00:29:01,145 --> 00:29:02,505
I'm not hungry.

488
00:29:02,585 --> 00:29:04,225
Do we really have to be like this?

489
00:29:04,305 --> 00:29:05,785
From the moment you raised your sword

490
00:29:05,865 --> 00:29:07,545
against Mengmeng in Sacred Ancestor Hall,

491
00:29:08,025 --> 00:29:08,985
was there still an "us"?

492
00:29:12,385 --> 00:29:13,265
Shen Zhishu.

493
00:29:14,545 --> 00:29:16,425
You know how much Mengmeng means to me.

494
00:29:22,425 --> 00:29:23,945
My mother died when I was young.

495
00:29:24,025 --> 00:29:26,545
Growing up, only Mengmeng
stayed by my side

496
00:29:26,625 --> 00:29:27,465
and cared for me.

497
00:29:28,065 --> 00:29:29,385
If she hadn't been there for me,

498
00:29:29,465 --> 00:29:31,345
I would've followed my mother long ago.

499
00:29:32,785 --> 00:29:34,865
And yet you could bring yourself

500
00:29:35,825 --> 00:29:37,185
to kill her?

501
00:29:37,265 --> 00:29:38,385
Fuzhi.

502
00:29:39,265 --> 00:29:41,025
I am not your Shen Zhishu alone.

503
00:29:41,705 --> 00:29:44,025
The woman I pointed my sword at that day

504
00:29:44,105 --> 00:29:45,545
was Zhongwan's Princess,
not your Mengmeng.

505
00:29:46,585 --> 00:29:48,505
She was a rebel intent
on destroying the court

506
00:29:48,585 --> 00:29:50,505
and destroying Daning.

507
00:29:50,585 --> 00:29:52,385
You know better than anyone

508
00:29:52,465 --> 00:29:53,625
how much good Mengmeng
has done for Daning.

509
00:29:53,705 --> 00:29:55,345
Shen Zhishu, answer me.

510
00:29:55,425 --> 00:29:57,665
Do you truly believe Mengmeng
would betray Daning

511
00:29:57,745 --> 00:29:59,145
or hurt His Majesty?

512
00:29:59,225 --> 00:30:00,345
Before everyone in that hall,

513
00:30:00,425 --> 00:30:02,625
if you were me,
what would you have chosen?

514
00:30:03,185 --> 00:30:04,705
Would you have done what Meng Tinghui did—

515
00:30:04,785 --> 00:30:06,145
defied His Majesty

516
00:30:07,585 --> 00:30:08,425
and betrayed Daning?

517
00:30:12,665 --> 00:30:13,665
Fuzhi.

518
00:30:13,745 --> 00:30:14,585
Leave me alone.

519
00:30:28,465 --> 00:30:30,545
Fuzhi, I know

520
00:30:31,225 --> 00:30:32,345
you've resented me all this time.

521
00:30:33,025 --> 00:30:35,185
If hating me makes you feel any better,

522
00:30:37,545 --> 00:30:38,985
then hate me for as long as you need.

523
00:30:44,625 --> 00:30:46,545
It's not that I refuse to walk beside you.

524
00:30:46,625 --> 00:30:47,865
But behind me

525
00:30:48,585 --> 00:30:50,825
stands a century of honor
earned by the Shen clan,

526
00:30:50,905 --> 00:30:53,265
and Daning's peace,
forged in soldiers' blood.

527
00:31:00,145 --> 00:31:02,585
I do hate you.

528
00:31:03,625 --> 00:31:06,305
I hate that you can't understand
that Mengmeng had no choice.

529
00:31:06,385 --> 00:31:08,665
I hate that you put a cold principle

530
00:31:08,745 --> 00:31:10,785
above what we have together.

531
00:31:13,665 --> 00:31:15,665
I hate that everything you say is right.

532
00:31:15,745 --> 00:31:17,425
But I still hate you.

533
00:31:17,505 --> 00:31:19,145
I hate you.

534
00:31:20,065 --> 00:31:21,825
Protecting Daning is my duty.

535
00:31:23,265 --> 00:31:24,225
Protecting you

536
00:31:25,905 --> 00:31:26,985
is my instinct.

537
00:31:42,945 --> 00:31:43,985
The east gate is under attack!

538
00:31:44,065 --> 00:31:45,505
-Send reinforcements!
-Move!

539
00:31:45,585 --> 00:31:46,985
-Hurry!
-Move!

540
00:31:47,865 --> 00:31:48,705
Go!

541
00:32:19,145 --> 00:32:20,225
Who started the fire?

542
00:32:22,785 --> 00:32:24,585
Your Highness, shadow guards
attacked the supply camp.

543
00:32:25,345 --> 00:32:26,945
Ying Gua must have sent them.

544
00:32:29,505 --> 00:32:30,505
Someone is retreating
toward the east gate.

545
00:32:30,585 --> 00:32:31,465
After them!

546
00:32:34,785 --> 00:32:35,745
Princess.

547
00:32:35,825 --> 00:32:37,425
Your life is too precious to risk.

548
00:32:37,505 --> 00:32:38,465
Please remain here and coordinate.

549
00:32:50,865 --> 00:32:52,345
Is it true?

550
00:32:53,905 --> 00:32:54,785
It is.

551
00:32:55,345 --> 00:32:57,065
You truly mean to marry Shangguan Zhao

552
00:32:58,305 --> 00:32:59,145
and proclaim yourself sovereign?

553
00:32:59,225 --> 00:33:01,505
My people were bullied to death

554
00:33:01,585 --> 00:33:02,945
by Daning soldiers.

555
00:33:03,025 --> 00:33:04,385
Every night when I close my eyes,

556
00:33:05,625 --> 00:33:08,585
a hundred thousand dead souls
weep blood in my ears.

557
00:33:08,665 --> 00:33:10,465
Murong Yao,

558
00:33:12,785 --> 00:33:14,305
why won't you fight?

559
00:33:15,145 --> 00:33:16,385
If you were me,

560
00:33:17,585 --> 00:33:19,145
what would you choose?

561
00:33:21,065 --> 00:33:23,305
There is no way to have both.

562
00:33:25,545 --> 00:33:26,785
You love your Daning.

563
00:33:27,705 --> 00:33:29,145
I love my Zhongwan too.

564
00:33:30,305 --> 00:33:31,425
On our wedding day,

565
00:33:31,505 --> 00:33:32,745
you let me leave.

566
00:33:34,465 --> 00:33:36,345
Today, I'll say I never saw you.

567
00:33:36,425 --> 00:33:37,625
From this moment on,

568
00:33:39,305 --> 00:33:40,425
we owe each other nothing.

569
00:33:54,305 --> 00:33:55,505
Your Majesty's foresight
was extraordinary.

570
00:33:55,585 --> 00:33:57,185
First we burned Beijian's supplies

571
00:33:57,265 --> 00:33:58,385
and threw their camp into chaos.

572
00:33:58,465 --> 00:34:00,745
Then our troops donned golden-thread mail

573
00:34:00,825 --> 00:34:02,585
and ambushed them at Xigu Pass.

574
00:34:02,665 --> 00:34:04,625
Beijian's main force
was completely routed.

575
00:34:05,185 --> 00:34:06,585
Beijian suffered a crushing first defeat.

576
00:34:06,665 --> 00:34:07,825
They will counterattack
with everything they have.

577
00:34:08,425 --> 00:34:09,745
We cannot let down our guard.

578
00:34:09,825 --> 00:34:10,945
-Yes.
-Yes.

579
00:34:13,785 --> 00:34:14,625
Shangguan Zhao.

580
00:34:16,385 --> 00:34:17,345
Where is Meng Tinghui?

581
00:34:17,905 --> 00:34:19,225
The Princess has returned
to the detached palace

582
00:34:19,305 --> 00:34:20,585
to prepare for her coronation.

583
00:34:20,665 --> 00:34:22,145
At Xigu Pass,

584
00:34:22,225 --> 00:34:24,505
you cost Beijian dearly.

585
00:34:25,505 --> 00:34:26,385
Speak.

586
00:34:26,465 --> 00:34:28,265
Did your Princess secretly
collude with Daning?

587
00:34:28,345 --> 00:34:29,825
Your Highness.

588
00:34:29,905 --> 00:34:31,825
Victory and defeat are common in war.

589
00:34:31,905 --> 00:34:34,465
To accuse us before the truth is known

590
00:34:34,545 --> 00:34:36,025
is far too hasty.

591
00:34:38,305 --> 00:34:40,585
Daning's shadow guards retreated west,

592
00:34:40,665 --> 00:34:43,185
yet you falsely claimed they went east.

593
00:34:43,265 --> 00:34:44,345
Speak.

594
00:34:44,425 --> 00:34:45,905
Were you secretly aiding the enemy?

595
00:34:45,985 --> 00:34:47,625
What I saw that night

596
00:34:47,705 --> 00:34:48,705
was the east gate.

597
00:34:49,865 --> 00:34:51,065
Your Highness.

598
00:34:51,145 --> 00:34:52,505
If she truly dares aid the enemy,

599
00:34:52,985 --> 00:34:54,505
I will kill her with my own hands.

600
00:34:54,585 --> 00:34:56,305
Then I'll clean house for you.

601
00:34:59,105 --> 00:35:01,265
Sir, your hand...

602
00:35:05,105 --> 00:35:06,225
Shangguan Zhao.

603
00:35:07,105 --> 00:35:08,145
Your dog

604
00:35:09,105 --> 00:35:11,305
has begun thinking thoughts she shouldn't.

605
00:35:12,145 --> 00:35:12,985
Guards.

606
00:35:13,705 --> 00:35:14,545
Take her away.

607
00:35:23,505 --> 00:35:26,265
Ying Gua's forces are concentrated
at Xigu Pass.

608
00:35:26,345 --> 00:35:28,305
While he has lowered his guard,

609
00:35:28,985 --> 00:35:31,305
we should strike Jinxia Pass,
Daning's throat.

610
00:35:32,705 --> 00:35:35,465
I want Ying Gua to watch his vast realm

611
00:35:36,505 --> 00:35:38,585
turn into a sea of blood.

612
00:35:52,745 --> 00:35:54,825
What did you hide from the Princess?

613
00:35:54,905 --> 00:35:56,305
It had nothing to do with her.

614
00:35:57,065 --> 00:35:58,425
Beijian harbors predatory ambitions

615
00:35:58,505 --> 00:35:59,425
and cannot be trusted.

616
00:35:59,505 --> 00:36:01,145
I won't watch you bargain with a tiger.

617
00:36:06,745 --> 00:36:09,345
As long as Daning is destroyed,
I don't care what it costs.

618
00:36:10,145 --> 00:36:11,265
I was the one who saved you.

619
00:36:11,345 --> 00:36:12,625
I was the one who taught you the sword.

620
00:36:13,425 --> 00:36:15,025
And now the one betraying me

621
00:36:15,745 --> 00:36:17,465
is you?

622
00:36:17,545 --> 00:36:19,385
I cannot watch you keep
making the same mistake.

623
00:36:21,505 --> 00:36:23,385
Look at what you've become.

624
00:36:23,465 --> 00:36:25,625
Are you still doing this
for Zhongwan's people?

625
00:36:25,705 --> 00:36:28,345
You're using their blood

626
00:36:28,425 --> 00:36:29,825
to feed your own selfish desire.

627
00:36:30,825 --> 00:36:32,225
You hate that the Princess
fell in love with Ying Gua.

628
00:36:32,305 --> 00:36:33,585
Then go kill Ying Gua.

629
00:36:36,625 --> 00:36:38,465
But don't make thousands of innocents

630
00:36:38,545 --> 00:36:39,865
die with you.

631
00:36:39,945 --> 00:36:41,905
Don't think I won't kill you.

632
00:36:45,505 --> 00:36:47,265
You gave me this life.

633
00:36:48,225 --> 00:36:49,705
I'm giving it back to you.

634
00:36:50,585 --> 00:36:51,945
If I die by your hand,

635
00:36:55,225 --> 00:36:56,585
I accept it willingly.

636
00:37:04,545 --> 00:37:05,545
Get out.

637
00:37:05,625 --> 00:37:07,505
Before I change my mind.

638
00:37:11,145 --> 00:37:12,625
Let's leave together.

639
00:37:13,865 --> 00:37:15,665
Far away from all this conflict.

640
00:37:30,625 --> 00:37:32,625
You all say I've gone mad.

641
00:37:32,705 --> 00:37:33,745
But if I hadn't,

642
00:37:34,265 --> 00:37:35,945
how could I have survived

643
00:37:36,025 --> 00:37:37,785
more than ten years of hatred?

644
00:37:37,809 --> 00:37:39,809
MkvDrama

